"P1496485270" "You found the residue of some chemical substance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1812747998" "You defeated the Devouring Earth and recovered a sample of the drug they produced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2068258436" "I've heard of Fauna First; they're a radical environmentalist group that's been accused of more than one act of sabotage against polluting businesses. You say they were working with the Devouring Earth? The creatures have tried such a tactic before, but it's never long before they turn on their human co-conspirators. I suspect we haven't heard the last of this business, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P3140052460" "{HeroName} protected the Paragon Technological Institute from the Devouring Earth! I saw it on the news!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P884868606" "The residue you discovered after the Devouring Earth attack on the Paragon Technical Institute indicates that they were working on something. Finding out what it was could give us a clue to their eventual plan. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take this residue over to Dr. Steven Sheridan.</A> Maybe he can tell us what the Devouring Earth were cooking up in that lab."
// AcceptString :
"P4102550093" "Take the residue to Dr. Steven Sheridan"
// SendOffString :
"P1198230349" "Dr. Sheridan may well be the smartest person I know. I don't doubt he'll have some good info for us."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2954792469" "Take residue to Dr. Sheridan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1011928378" "I want to know Sheridan's findings as soon as possible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1874409455" "Hamidon will cover the Earth with his seed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2622930739" "This sample is of a medicine that weakens the immune system. Doctors use similar medication when they're doing a major organ transplant; it keeps the body from rejecting the new organ. I'd guess the Devouring Earth plan to turn this substance into a virus, to weaken all of our immune systems so that we're more susceptible to their mutagens. They never stop trying to wipe us out, do they? I don't know if even the Rikti hate humanity this much!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1497001400" "We need to know more, and I think I know where to look: the ecological activist group, Fauna First. If they helped the Devouring Earth produce that chemical, they may well know the next phase of the plan. The organization has been deep undercover ever since they were accused of bombing an oil plant last year, but I'll see what I can ferret out."
// RandomFameString :
"P2000585168" "Did you see {HeroName} take on the Devouring Earth? That's one tough hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2541794440" "I think I've come up with a lead on Fauna First, the activist group that was working with the Devouring Earth. It turns out they have a front company located over in Founders' Falls, Oaktree Stationers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to the Fauna First front company, make some arrests, and see if you can figure out what the Devouring Earth is up to.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1731926220" "Go to the Fauna First front company and make some arrests"
// SendOffString :
"P3875324973" "These people may be fanatics, but they're still paragon citizens. Take care of them, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1525046132" "Defeat foes at Fauna First"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1696401509" "I want to know what's going on at Fauna First. Today, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2141575634" "A sharp wail is cut off in a gasp. It seems all is not well for Fauna First activists."

