// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P456444975" "It seems that the Devouring Earth was after Tanya Tyler specifically, but what I can't figure out is why they were working with Fauna First, or if there's a connection with all of this and that drug they made. One thing is certain though: <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We've got to find out where the Devouring Earth have taken Tanya Tyler.</A> She may be the one who can answer a lot of these questions. I want you to hit the streets in Founders' Falls and look for clues on any Devouring Earth monsters you find."
// AcceptString :
"P1020224911" "Find out where the Devouring Earth have taken Tanya Tyler"
