// ModelDisplayName :
"P3475908937" "Rubble"
// InteractBeginString :
"P429746428" "You notice something in the rubble."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2963344158" "You pick something up."
// InteractActionString :
"P4018751421" "Sifting..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P55746750" "You found a letter!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3251330208" "You defeated the Devouring Earth and found a clue to Tanya Tyler's location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1185045813" "What's this, then? A love letter! To Tanya Tyler, from the 'Hamidon' the Devouring Earth are always talking about! How strange, and how disturbing. I think you had better go after this woman right away, {HeroName}. I'm beginning to have grave fears for her well-being."
// RandomFameString :
"P3596051385" "{HeroName} routed a whole nest of Devouring Earth monsters in Brickstown!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3516171195" "Time to go to work, {HeroName}. I think I've pinned down where the Devouring Earth have Tanya. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue Tanya Tyler from the Devouring Earth.</A> Maybe she'll be able to shed some light on this most interesting missive from Hamidon."
// AcceptString :
"P3847029895" "Rescue Tanya Tyler from the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P4082583909" "I think Tanya's the lynchpin to the Devouring Earth's new plan. Find her, and we may find the information we're looking for."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P637109434" "Rescue Tanya Tyler"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P385951629" "A woman's voice pleads for freedom; the only answer is an unintelligible grunt."

