// Dialog :
"P583782117" "You rescued the technicians and learned about the Devouring Earth's latest theft."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1019210611" "The fertility drugs, Hamidon's letter to Tanya. I think I'm beginning to put this together, {HeroName}. We know that Hamidon's tried to create a progenitor before, a being that can produce more Devouring Earth creatures. He's always been thwarted in that attempt, but what if he's found another way? I believe Hamidon intends to make Tanya into a Devouring Earth matriarch, a breeder for new monsters! Remember, he referred to her as Terra. We will have to guard that young woman very carefully."
// RandomFameString :
"P2471521234" "My dad's lab was attacked by the Devouring Earth. Thank goodness for {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2591761173" "The last round of drug raids make me think that the Devouring Earth aren't through with Tanya Tyler. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go to the safehouse and debrief Tanya.</A>  Anything she can tell us about the Devouring Earth's plan could help us protect her."
// AcceptString :
"P4234369343" "Go to the safehouse and debrief Tanya"
// SendOffString :
"P3960709046" "If I'm right, this woman has been targeted for a very gruesome experiment. Watch your back, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P748136628" "Protect safehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P735485840" "I really want to hear Tanya's story again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1549927916" "From a block away, you could tell something was wrong. Where are the guards?"

