// Dialog :
"P645856878" "Time is of the essence, {HeroName}. You've got to get that woman back, and not just for her own safety. If we're right about what the Devouring Earth is planning for her, the whole world could be in danger!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3403534486" "Did you see {HeroName} throw down with those Devouring Earth monsters?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4286906425" "I think I've got a lead for you, {HeroName}. Some businessmen over in Founders' Falls said they saw a woman matching Tanya Tyler's description being dragged into a cave by a bunch of Devouring Earth creatures. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over there and rescue Tanya.</A> I'm worried that the Devouring Earth's plot is close to bearing fruit. I only hope we can stop them before it's too late."
// SendOffString :
"P1500188896" "The sooner the better, {HeroName}. They may already have all the drugs they need to begin altering that woman!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3078977469" "You don't have the luxury of time on this one, {HeroName}. Tanya's in desperate danger."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3418472104" "You hear the sound of heartfelt, choking sobs."

