"P702581337" "You rescued Tanya Tyler, but not before the Devouring Earth could perform an experiment on her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1747087859" "So we were right. Hamidon's trying to turn Tanya into some sort of Devouring Earth breeder. I'll get her over to a lab right away. Maybe, just maybe, the docs will find a way to reverse the process."
// RandomFameString :
"P3631207710" "{HeroName} saved some green chick in Founders' Falls. I saw it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P145476315" "Bad news, {HeroName}. The doctors weren't able to help Tanya before the change took place. She turned into a monster right before their very eyes! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to track her down, {HeroName}, and defeat her before she breeds any more creatures like herself.</A> Otherwise, the world may never be the same."
// AcceptString :
"P1302814776" "Track Tanya down before she breeds more creatures like herself"
// SendOffString :
"P2527640422" "I heard that she's rampaging in a local neighborhood, Allegeheney Square. There's an emergency force field in place, but someone's got to go in there and contain Tanya. That someone had better be you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P855642103" "Track down altered Tanya"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2491062412" "You've got to defeat Tanya, {HeroName}, before it's too late!"

